<title>UK: Fitzwilton Finance sets 80 mln stg 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Fitzwilton Finance sets 80 mln stg 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following senior secured global bond was announced by joint lead managers Bankers Trust and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FITZWILTON FINANCE (UK) PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  F.A WELLWORTH &amp; CO LTD AND WELLWORTH PROPERTIES</p>
<p> AMT    80 MLN STG    COUPON     ***	 MATURITY    11.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  ***	 PAY DATE    11.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    ***	 SPREAD	+175 BP</p>
<p>LISTING    LONDON     DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT 2006 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	***TO BE PRICED LATER.</p>
<p>		   THE BONDS AND GUARANTEES ARE SECURED BY MORTGAGES</p>
<p>		   AND CHARGES OVER THE COST OF LAND AND BUILDINGS</p>
<p>		   OF THE CHARGING COMPANIES.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
